        "note": "Stanford graduate students J.S. Brugler, J.D. Plummer, Roger Melen, P. Salsbury, G.J. Alonzo, John Hill, Charles Rogers, Jon Taenzer worked on the silicon retina, bimorph drivers, tactile frequency, and reading-rate experiments. SRI contributors included James Baer and John Gill (optics & packaging). Harry Garland suggested and Roger Melen & Max Maginness built the 1972 one-hand redesign."
